2026-06-30 17:39:58,837 | AGENT | AIInnovation Agent answered: Based on the company context, our platform Atelier can be proposed as a solution to provide artificial-intelligence assistance to the client's professionals. The core approach of our platform is Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), which generates answers from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus and cites those passages, ensuring that the information provided is grounded in validated material.

